One structured entry per phase. Consolidated into INTERVIEW.md and cleared at
each checkpoint (end of Phases 4, 9, 13, 17, 22).

Cleared at the Phase 22 checkpoint — Phases 18 through 22 now live in
INTERVIEW.md (§9 concurrency, §13 decisions, §14 questions, §15 weaknesses,
